  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Blowpipe grass is the specialty of northern plains. Every stalk looks like an erect long pipe. When wind blows, it enters small holes on the grass and produces pleasant pipe sounds. It is a common material used in Gu refinement. A large expanse of blowpipe grass slowly gives birth to some sound path and wood path Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        476
      ],
