      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pipe-shaped-grass",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "South Sea Turtle Immortal lists ten thousand stalks of blowpipe grass as the asking price for a turtleback myriad wolf king on sale. Fang Yuan has none at the time. He knows where they grow, but that season they are only seeds buried under the earth. The seller later accepts immortal essence stones instead.",
